        "content": "{\"original_question\": \"I recently attended an event where there was a unique blend of modern beats with Pacific sounds.\", \"task\": {\"question\": \"What events have I attended recently that involved music or sound?\", \"output_slot\": \"recent_events\", \"answer_type\": \"set\", \"inputs\": [], \"execution\": \"retrieval\"}, \"grounded_subquestion\": \"What events have I attended recently that involved music or sound?\", \"request_context\": {\"query_identity\": \"14f425f87287d462ca8137ef1a2a031ba3b5e2ae583dfeabdea3ba3234eb0d39\", \"algorithm_version\": \"dagbt_residual_memory_v1\", \"program_identity\": \"0c359a214dbc2356a671be7d511e73c3a0c25c7e7bc9139c67346fff18db810a\", \"initial_dag_identity\": \"83cf01de5c01e7934a39bd71a9f01a121fd31b1d73abdcf5b17b597c63563912\"}, \"variables\": {\"recent_events\": {\"type\": \"set\", \"demand\": \"recent_events\", \"open\": true}}, \"required_scope\": {\"entity_scope\": \"event\", \"time_scope\": \"recent\"}, \"output_contract\": {\"mode\": \"value\", \"result_type\": \"entity\", \"entity_scope\": \"event\", \"time_scope\": \"recent\", \"explanation\": \"one\"}, \"program_revision\": 0, \"rule_binding\": null, \"supported_parents\": {}, \"known_observations\": [{\"id\": \"fact_80a5dba1a3787c1f8df735ca\", \"stance\": \"support\", \"value\": [\"local electronic music festival featuring Pacific Islander artists\"], \"source_ids\": [\"s33\", \"s34\", \"s35\"], \"entity_scope\": \"event\", \"time_scope\": \"recent\", \"parent_versions\": {}, \"retract_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"User explicitly states attending a local electronic music festival that featured Pacific Islander artists, describing the experience as recent and involving music/sound. The text supports a single event with music involvement.\", \"variable\": \"recent_events\", \"revoked\": [], \"semantic_status\": \"model_judgment\"}], \"source_spans\": [{\"id\": \"s33\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:81a2d7dd6c8d884879d250ba9f1ec76ce69aac12e96f4f2586f5e4fc9d57c1cd\", \"start\": 105, \"end\": 442, \"text\": \"User: I had a spectacular week with music recently! I attended a local electronic music festival that featured some surprising Pacific Islander artists. It was such a delight to see how their traditional sounds merged with modern electronic beats, creating a unique auditory experience that was both familiar and alien at the same time. \", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [48], \"time_metadata\": {\"observed_start\": 48.0, \"observed_end\": 49.0, \"event_start\": null, \"event_end\": null, \"validity\": \"unknown\", \"time_source\": \"message_index\"}}, {\"id\": \"s34\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:81a2d7dd6c8d884879d250ba9f1ec76ce69aac12e96f4f2586f5e4fc9d57c1cd\", \"start\": 442, \"end\": 800, \"text\": \"The vibrant colors of the festival decorations caught my eye, and they reflected the rich cultural heritage of the Pacific Islands, showcasing everything from intricate textiles to eye-catching art pieces. In between the performances, I chatted with fellow attendees, and we shared our favorite acts, which made the atmosphere even more lively and engaging. \", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [48], \"time_metadata\": {\"observed_start\": 48.0, \"observed_end\": 49.0, \"event_start\": null, \"event_end\": null, \"validity\": \"unknown\", \"time_source\": \"message_index\"}}, {\"id\": \"s35\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:81a2d7dd6c8d884879d250ba9f1ec76ce69aac12e96f4f2586f5e4fc9d57c1cd\", \"start\": 800, \"end\": 918, \"text\": \"Overall, it was a heartwarming reminder of the power of music to bring people together and celebrate diverse cultures.\", \"source_role\": \"user\", \"source_message_indices\": [48], \"time_metadata\": {\"observed_start\": 48.0, \"observed_end\": 49.0, \"event_start\": null, \"event_end\": null, \"validity\": \"unknown\", \"time_source\": \"message_index\"}}, {\"id\": \"s145\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:884c4465940463950185be