pening more than ever. \", \"source_role\": \"assistant\", \"source_message_indices\": [63], \"time_metadata\": {\"observed_start\": 61.0, \"observed_end\": 63.0, \"event_start\": null, \"event_end\": null, \"validity\": \"unknown\", \"time_source\": \"message_index\"}}, {\"id\": \"s155\", \"doc_id\": \"personamem:memory:884c4465940463950185be8e682390f4f6652cc329b461d7e9a24fcbcd4705b5\", \"start\": 2240, \"end\": 2509, \"text\": \"I would love to hear about what other projects you are working on, taking into account this delightful fusion of your cultural background with contemporary influences, as every artistic endeavor has the potential to reflect both personal growth and collective heritage.\", \"source_role\": \"assistant\", \"source_message_indices\": [63], \"time_metadata\": {\"observed_start\": 61.0, \"observed_end\": 63.0, \"event_start\": null, \"event_end\": null, \"validity\": \"unknown\", \"time_source\": \"message_index\"}}], \"rules_completion_required\": false, \"supported_task_outputs\": {}}"
